# Cursor Cloud Instructions

@AGENTS.md
@docs/development-workflow.md
@docs/ecommerce/onboarding.md

Use the commands and backend-mode prerequisites in those docs. The dev server does not provision transaction,
chat or payment services. Use only explicitly supplied staging credentials for authorized checks; never print or commit
them. Do not assume a recovery secret exists in the environment or that a synthetic suite proves live sign-in/payments.

Use the actual intended PR base (`master` or a selected train), following `docs/commit-message.md` and
`docs/ecommerce/release.md`; do not create branches from the old fork's `dev` by default. Keep the Market pre-push gate.
